{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51373","headline":"汉文帝母薄太后庙赋诗 · 牛僧孺","name":"汉文帝母薄太后庙赋诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香风引上大罗天，月地花宫拜洞仙。\n具道人间惆怅事，不知今夕是何年。\n（《唐诗纪事》二九引《周秦行纪》（《周秦行纪》，一般认爲是李党托牛僧孺之作，《贾氏谈录》谓韦瓘作。\n诗系牛僧孺名下，恐未允。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛僧孺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}